OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANew videos of man in 9/11 lawsuit
OL,4,Areveal extremist links
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man at the heart of a $1 trillion
OL,7,F(#733bn) lawsuit brought by 9/11
OL,8,Ffamilies had extensive links to Saudi
OL,9,Fgovernment officials and went
OL,10,Fpaintballing with one of al-Qaeda's
OL,11,Ffuture leaders, video obtained by the
OL,12,FBBC reveals.
OL,14,FThe footage, which the FBI had within
OL,15,Fdays of the 2001 attacks, stands in
OL,16,Fstark contrast to Omar al-Bayoumi's 25
OL,17,Fyears of denials that he was an
OL,18,Fextremist and a Saudi spy.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
